om2
note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note q: entry count, entry bytes, valid-byte offset, key offset, key bytes.
fn ar_cm q view ulong 8 a view uchar * key view uchar * i ulong to ulong
b = mul i get q 1
if eq get a add b get q 2 0
ret 0
end
b = add b get q 3
for j ulong len key
if ne get a add b j get key j
ret 0
end
end
ret 1
end
fn arcache q view ulong 8 a view uchar * key view uchar * to ulong
for i ulong get q 0
if ne ar_cm q a key i 0
ret i
end
end
ret 18446744073709551615
end
